RAPTOR Flowchart Program
Title: Find String Length
Variables: input_string (String), length (Integer)
Symbols:
  1. Start
  2. Input: input_string
  3. Assignment: length := 0
  4. Loop Condition: input_string[length] != ""
     - Yes: length := length + 1
     - No: Exit Loop
  5. Output: "Length of the string is: " + length
  6. End
